  "details": "This module enables you to \"share\" a view display within another website via an iframe.\n\nThe module doesn't sufficiently block access to view displays. Although the views data is not displayed, resource-intensive views could still be executed which could affect site performance.\n\nThis vulnerability is mitigated by the fact that an attacker must know the view and display IDs.",
